<title>BELGIUM: EU cereals management committee will be routine.</title>
<headline>EU cereals management committee will be routine.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union cereals management committee meeting on Wednesday will be routine, an EU official said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;The agenda lists only the routine rice and cereals tenders, standing refunds and correctives to be dealt with,&quot; the official said. -- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6800 Chris White</p>
